@title The Den — hibernate $UPTOBEAR until waking, vote for any token.
 @notice Deposits are locked until `UNLOCK`. There is no early exit and no admin of any kind.
         Weight = sum over deposits of amount × seconds until unlock. Weight is both the vote power
         and the basket share paid by the Treasury, so what you steer is what you receive.
         Votes are sticky and can be changed any time. The contract enforces nothing about the
         vote result; it is the public record the operator executes.
